      "title": "Australian households face prospect of interest rate hike and petrol prices rising above $2 a litre",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/25/australian-households-prospect-interest-rate-hike-petrol-prices-rising",
      "description": "<p>Economists’ warning comes as escalating Middle East crisis pushes global crude oil back above $US100 a barrel</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Australian households face the prospect of a Reserve Bank interest rate hike and petrol prices above $2 a litre over the coming weeks, economists warn, as the escalating Middle East crisis pushes global crude back above $US100 a barrel.</p><p>Financial markets now see an even chance the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/22/rba-interest-rate-rise-likely-us-iran-war-markets-forecast\">RBA board</a> will deliver a fourth cash rate increase at the next meeting on 11 August.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/25/australian-households-prospect-interest-rate-hike-petrol-prices-rising\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-24T15:00:19"
    },
    {
      "title": "Pauline Hanson’s domestic violence comments were no stumble",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/24/pauline-hanson-domestic-violence-comments-mra-mens-rights-activists-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>The One Nation leader has allied herself with men’s rights activists for years, consistently suggesting women routinely make false allegations of violence </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/jul/24/australia-news-live-jim-chalmers-anthony-albanese-labor-conference-gas-tax-gambling-reform-one-nation-pauline-hanson-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>For a decade, Pauline Hanson has been beating the same drum.</p><p>Her comments this week – <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/22/brittany-higgins-pauline-hanson-domestic-violence-comments-ntwnfb\">suggesting domestic violence was a “two-way street” </a>and questioning why women did not simply leave abusive relationships – have caused significant concern and been <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/23/pauline-hanson-said-domestic-violence-prevented-police-from-dealing-with-real-in-2025-podcast-ntwnfb\">labelled “dangerous” </a>by experts and other commentators.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/24/pauline-hanson-domestic-violence-comments-mra-mens-rights-activists-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-24T15:00:16"
    },
    {
      "title": "Trump threatens EU with ‘substantial’ tariffs over fines of US tech giants",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/trump-european-union-tariffs",
      "description": "<p>After Google fined €890m by EU, US president said Brussels was ‘robbing’ American companies and taxpayers</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/23/trump-tariffs-what-to-know\">What to know about Trump’s new tariffs on more than 80 countries</a></p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump\">Donald Trump</a> has threatened the European Union with additional and “substantial” tariffs after Brussels imposed a series of <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/23/eu-fines-google-for-competition-breaches-over-search-and-apps\">steep fines</a> on US tech giants.</p><p>The US president accused Brussels of taking “direct aim” at several American companies including Apple, Meta Platforms, Amazon and Google,<strong> </strong>writing in a Truth Social post: “The United States of America is not a ‘PIGGYBANK’ for Europe, nor will we allow it to be!”</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/trump-european-union-tariffs\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-24T21:22:39"
    },
    {
      "title": "Trump switched planes in Turkey earlier this month because of threat from Iran proxy forces – report",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/trump-air-force-one-iran-threat",
      "description": "<p>President flew to Ankara onboard Qatari-gifted jet, without advanced defenses, and flew home on old Air Force One</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump\">Donald Trump</a> switched aircraft before departing <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/turkey\">Turkey</a> earlier this month after US officials determined there was a credible threat from Iranian proxy forces targeting him and Air Force One, according to a new report from the <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/trump-plane-iran-threat.html?campaign_id=60&amp;emc=edit_na_20260724&amp;instance_id=179293&amp;nl=breaking-news&amp;regi_id=212238806&amp;segment_id=223642&amp;user_id=231bbfbd12c9d7bf634e1e285de0bfa5\">New York Times</a>.</p><p>The threat surfaced while the US president was attending the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/nato\">Nato</a> summit. He had arrived in Ankara onboard the new Qatari-donated Boeing 747-8, an aircraft that Trump acknowledged does not have the same advanced <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/20/trump-air-force-one-qatar\">defensive systems</a> as the older Air Force One.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/trump-air-force-one-iran-threat\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-24T21:50:56"
    },
    {
